message: "If you use Particula Primordial in research or teaching, please cite this repository."
title: "Particula Primordial: An Auditable Toolkit for Computational Music Analysis and Scale-Transposable Composition"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
type: software
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An open-source toolkit for MIDI note-event analysis and temporal normalization,
  transposable scale catalogs, scale-derived harmony and algorithmic melody generation,
  audio reference rendering, and conservative REAPER project inventory analysis.
